{"date":"2025-12-23","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_ca179b85fcb5938a8e245c6ab0f3b2fe","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1766482200,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-12-20","chunk":0,"id":"m_9ad2be104c6db9b1e3a6ba7b4a951ec6"}}},{"id":"m_9618c9cb8ffa6d3c833bf90b9123359c","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1766482237,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_57f21138bd709904c8cc1dbef42fccd9","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1766482274,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6bc27a740b9dbc3cb54edc15be43b442","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1766482311,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_abbb8faed1bb3ac66aceef6e17b294de","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1766482348,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_d096cc60237d34fa1105cc0b1b85c0eb","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1766482385,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_08ade112e63e11a16c95e5d07fd8b927","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1766482422,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_50282c83d0f544d32511139a4f2b3c3b","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1766482459,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6334217c8b03ee5d03a4bd8690e66f98","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1766482496,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_eeed5b148e414ec27e1ca29bb082838f","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1766482533,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e876c25a73cabab6ece3b7b90cc4a4b1","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音