43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_cb573ce6550a81fc791b87275e1741c8","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1766483051,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
